# No raw or interim data, no bulk processed splits, no mlruns, no CLAUDE.md
# in the build context. The two exceptions are the baked champion artifacts
# (data/processed/models/lightgbm/model_chosen.joblib and calibrator.joblib)
# that the Dockerfile explicitly COPYs - everything else under data/ is
# excluded below, including the other two models (scorecard, xgboost) and
# the unconstrained-reference LightGBM artifact, none of which the API uses.
data/raw/
data/interim/
data/processed/*.parquet
data/processed/models/scorecard/
data/processed/models/xgboost/
data/processed/models/lightgbm/model_best_unconstrained.joblib
data/processed/models/lightgbm/features.json

mlruns/
mlflow.db
mlartifacts/

.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.git/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage

notebooks/
docs/
tests/

CLAUDE.md
.env
kaggle.json
.DS_Store
*.egg-info/

reports/figures/
reports/drift/
